  <!-- ============================================================
       竜人 (Dragonkin) - 秘境に稀に現れる竜の血を引く者。
       特殊能力: 火、移動が速い
       ============================================================ -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>JP_Dragonkin</defName>
    <label>dragonkin</label>
    <description>竜の血を引くと伝えられる、鱗に覆われた人型の存在。あらゆる秘境にごく稀に現れ、鋭い鉤爪と厚い鱗で並の武装を寄せ付けない。爪には炎を纏い、俊敏に飛びかかる。目撃例が極めて少ない伝説的な脅威。\n\nA scaled, humanoid being said to carry the blood of dragons. Rarely encountered in remote wilds anywhere, its sharp talons and thick scales shrug off ordinary weapons, and it strikes swiftly with claws wreathed in flame - a legendary threat few have lived to describe in detail.</description>
